    <description>Electric pressure cooker, about 0.34 m across the grips and 0.336 m tall, authored from primitives: black cylindrical body, stainless rim with an ellipsoid domed lid, a curved capsule grab handle on rounded posts, a centred spherical pressure knob beneath it, capsule side grips and an oval control panel with a lit display. Replaces a 25,054-triangle Google Scanned Objects scan.</description>
